description=(WIP) New melee weapon-crafting mod. 137 HARMONIE weapons + every vanilla melee weapon craftable through a custom procedural crafting UI, all built from a single universal Metal Ingot base material (pick a recipe, perform its required procedures from a shared library, finish to produce the item), plus a separate weapon modification UI (Grip/Head/Tactical/Weight upgrade slots, works on any melee weapon). Full EN/TH translations included.
